  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSunny, private and beautifully presented, this is an opportunity to secure an easy-care home in a location that’s hard to beat.\r\n\r\nOne of just three in a boutique brick-and-tile block, this elevated one-bedroom home offers comfortable living with plenty to love. Polished timber floors bring warmth and character, while the brand-new bathroom and air conditioning add modern convenience. Meticulously maintained, it's ready to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nBut it's the outdoor space that really sets this property apart. A generous, sun-soaked private garden offers room to relax, entertain or get creative with the new garden beds, new fencing, retaining and upgraded drainage already completed, the hard work has been taken care of.\r\n\r\nLocation is another big tick. Enjoy easy walks to Shakespeare Road, Milford shops and the beautiful surrounds of Lake Pupuke. Families will also appreciate zoning for Takapuna Normal Intermediate and both Westlake Boys and Westlake Girls High Schools.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing or adding to your investment portfolio, this is a smart little package in a sought-after Milford location.\r\n\r\nPrivate, sunny and packed with appeal – don't let this one pass you by. \r\n\r\nCall today to arrange your viewing.",
